From c31838b5037f5b7236c755f734447f22fbd3972e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: trustno1-coder <canthuit7@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:42:19 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] NVIDIA: more dynamic descriptor slots; Series S interface
 plane (compose)

- present: VICTORY_COMPOSE=1 lays the Series S interface plane (4K) over the game plane (1080p); without it everything before gameplay is black. Ported from fxceless/victory-gta6 PR #1189 (compose.rs; FSR stand-in not ported, use VICTORY_OWN_UPSCALER=1).
- shader cache key includes VICTORY_BVH_MISS.
Measured on an RTX 5070, Series S, half scale: about 20-22 fps, no device loss.

(cherry picked from commit 7997a2036311334db7f830773e4ef6a929eace3c)
